* kg: local search index
** Problem
*** Many repositories, one agent
*** 5 calls per lookup (p90 17)
*** ripgrep: no ranking, noise
** Corpus
*** Resource units: submodule, scrape, folder
*** 8 categories: weights and filters
*** Size limit by kind of file
*** Data files: name only
*** Versioned docs collapse
** Index
*** SQLite FTS5, contentless
*** Chunks: headings, 60-line windows
*** Incremental: commit, mtime, hash
*** One transaction per resource
** Search
*** Quoted terms, OR
*** bm25 x category x name boost
*** Collapse and excerpts from disk
*** Text or JSON output
** Evaluation
*** 40 real questions, 20 held out
*** kg 18 vs ripgrep 4 in top 5
*** MRR 0.783 vs 0.110
** Verification findings
*** Readers wrote side files
*** immutable reader unsafe
*** bm25 drift: rebuild
*** Vendored files leaked
** Next
*** symbol, source, map, context
*** Line accuracy in code
*** More questions
